TN3270EX START     0
         STM       14,12,12(13)        Standard Entry Linkage
         BALR      12,0
         USING     *,12
*
* 1. TRANSMIT THE AUTO-COMPUTED DATA STREAM TO THE EMULATOR SCREEN
         TPUT      SCRNBUFF,SCRNLEN,FULLSCR
*
* 2. AWAIT AND READ RESPONSE DATA 
         TGET      INBUFF,8,ASIS
*
* 3. RETURN TO OPERATING SYSTEM
         LM        14,12,12(13)        Standard Exit Linkage
         XR        15,15
         BR        14
*
* 4. GENERATE THE DATA STREAM USING THE AUTOMATED TN3270 MACRO
SCRNBUFF DS        0X
*
* Field 1: Label at Row 1, Column 30 (Will generate 11405D dynamically)
         TN3270    CMD=WRITE,WCC=X'F1',                                X
               SBA=(1,30),                                             X
               SF=(PROT,NORM),                                         X
               TEXT='USER ID:'
*
* Field 2: Input Field at Row 1, Column 40 (Will generate 114067 
         TN3270    SBA=(1,40),                                         X
               SF=(UNPROT,NORM)
*
SCRNLEN  EQU       *-SCRNBUFF          Dynamic total length calculation
INBUFF   DS        CL8                 Receiving data field
         END       TN3270EX